{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53780","headline":"游紫霄宫七言八句（藏头拆字诗） · 白居易","name":"游紫霄宫七言八句（藏头拆字诗）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水洗尘埃道味甞，甘於於名利相相忘。\n心怀天洞丹霞客，各诵三清紫府章。\n早里采莲歌达旦，一轮明月桂飘香。\n日高公子还相觅，见得山中好酒浆。\n（见宋桑世昌《回文类聚》卷二引）（按：《回文类聚》收此诗作环行排列，各句首字皆略去。\n附《读法》云：「每句取第一字下半爲起字，从右转，首句用浆字之下半水字读起，如『水洗尘埃道味甞，甘於名利两相忘』是也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}